                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Every meter (the stage and Mixer track meters, the input and output setup meters and the OUT readout) is a peak meter: it rises at once to a new peak and otherwise falls 11.8 dB\/s, the digital peak meter's 20 dB in 1.7 s (IEC 60268-18), reading silence under -120 dBFS."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "28",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.4",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.4",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "textAlign": "left",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "28",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "textDirection": "ltr",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "- The engine holds the peak between the screen's reads, so a bar no longer jumps between audio callbacks or misses a peak, and a falling level comes down smoothly."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "28",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
